#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:49 index.docbook:102
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kapp; is a computerized version of a well known strategy game. A commercial "
"version exists and also another GPL clone but I (Gaël de Chalendar) created "
"this game as a C++ learning exercise and so, I developped it up to this "
"point (see README for details)."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:54 index.docbook:107
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In the current version, &kapp; is a multi-player network-enabled game with "
"an AI. (see TODO for details)"
msgstr ""

