#: index.docbook:875
#, no-c-format
msgid "Requirements"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:876
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To use &kapp;, you will need the kdegames package. To compile it, you must "
"have &Qt; 4.4 with STL support enabled (all modern &GNU;/&Linux; "
"distributions have ths kind of &Qt;) and the development package of kdegames."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:892
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"For a list of updates, you may refer to the application web site or the "
"ChangeLog file, or the README, etc."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:899
#, no-c-format
msgid "Compilation and Installation"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:901
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In order to compile and install &kapp; on your system, type the following in "
"the base directory of the &kapp; distribution:"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: screen
#: index.docbook:904
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<prompt>%</prompt> <userinput>./configure --prefix=&lt;your-KDE-root-"
"directory&gt;</userinput>\n"
"<prompt>%</prompt> <userinput>make</userinput>\n"
"<prompt>%</prompt> <userinput>make install</userinput>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:907
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Since &kapp; uses autoconf and automake you should have not trouble "
"compiling it. Should you run into problems please report them to the &kapp; "
"mailing lists."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:909
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Hopefully, I will also be able to distribute a rpm binary version of the "
"package."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:913
#, no-c-format
msgid "Configuration"
msgstr "Configuracion"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:915
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Note that you can move the toolbar and its position will be remembered. "
"There is no oher configuration needs."
msgstr ""
